@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="py-4">
    <div class="card card-agro p-4 p-md-5 border-0 shadow-sm max-w-800 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-4">AgroTransport Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
            This platform operates in compliance with standard academic guidelines for university course INT402. All farmer and transporter information stored within this application is utilized exclusively for agricultural logistics coordination and produce transportation pooling.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            We collect basic contact details (Full Name, Email, Mobile Number, Village, District, State) provided during user registration, vehicle details registered by transporters, and produce weight requirements submitted by farmers.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">2. How Data is Used</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Data is strictly used to match available freight vehicle capacity with farmer produce loads, calculate proportional transportation fares, and generate transit notifications.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">3. Security & Access</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">
            Passphrases are salted and hashed using ASP.NET Core Identity PBKDF2 cryptography. Role-based authorization prevents unauthorized cross-role data access.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

